# DESK16 "before": the Install-icon stepper walks SIX entries on this machine
# (BUILTIN_ICONS' seven minus the floppy, which `offered_icons` drops when the
# drive map reports no A:/B:).  Four clicks on the DOWN arrow from the
# hard-disk picture land on the APPLICATION picture -- there is no removable
# disk to land on.
#   C: icon click            (38,35)    probe run desktop dump
#   Options title hover      (196,9)    probe run menu dump
#   "Install icon..." click  (280,43)   probe run menu dump (entry 3.1)
#   ID_DOWN click            (334,320)  b3 run's [probe] ADINSDSK dump
#   ID_CNCL click            (415,369)  same dump
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1500 mark A_IDLE
2600 move 38 35
2900 down
2903 up
3200 move 600 240
4000 move 196 240
4100 move 196 9
4800 move 280 43
5100 down
5103 up
5400 move 600 240
6500 mark B_DIALOG
7600 move 334 320
7900 down
7903 up
8200 down
8203 up
8500 down
8503 up
8800 down
8803 up
9100 move 600 240
10200 mark C_STEP4
11300 move 415 369
11600 down
11603 up
11900 move 600 240
13000 mark D_CLOSED
14200 pause
